category: Libs
requires: libdb-devel libetpan26 libsasl2-devel libssl-devel pkg-config zlib-devel
sdesc: "Mail Framework for C Language (development)"
ldesc: "The purpose of this mail library is to provide a portable, efficient framework
for different kinds of mail access: IMAP, SMTP, POP and NNTP."
external-source: libetpan

